msgid "BlinkingReconnection"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:1
msgid "Regroupe les paramètres de reconnexion des trajectoires interrompues par le scintillement."
msgstr "Class containing the settings for reconnecting tracks in the event of scintillation."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:3
msgid "Paramètres regroupés :"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:5
msgid "``Mode`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : modèle de déplacement attendu, parmi ``Immobile``, ``Diffuse`` et ``Linear``."
msgstr "``Mode`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`): expected motion model, among ``Immobile``, ``Diffuse``, and ``Linear``."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:6
msgid "``Max Duration`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : durée maximale de l'interruption ; valeur par défaut : ``1`` plan."
msgstr "``Max Duration`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`): maximum interruption duration; default value: ``1`` plane."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:7
msgid "``Max Distance`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : distance maximale de reconnexion ; valeur par défaut : ``1.0`` pixel."
msgstr "``Max Distance`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`): maximum reconnection distance; default value: ``1.0`` pixel."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:9
msgid "Une distance supérieure à celle du suivi initial reste autorisée afin de reconnecter des points éloignés sur deux plans consécutifs."
msgstr "A distance greater than the initial tracking distance remains allowed so that distant points on two consecutive planes can be reconnected."

